    "title": "Alameda Museum Celebrates Women's History Month - NewsBreak",
    "text": "14 hours ago To celebrate Women’s History Month, the Alameda Museum is currently highlighting the lives of notable women of Alameda who made contributions to our island from the late 1800s to the 1990s. The show, Women of Alameda’s History, was curated and researched by Gemma Jackson and runs through March 29. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
